WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.480
The Single Market is another opportunity.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.800
Irish businesses can sell their products and services to customers in all EU countries

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:15.120
without facing many of the trade barriers that exist with non-EU countries.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.000
The Government could help smaller Irish companies understand EU regulations and support

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.480
them in expanding into European markets.
